# Phase 10F evidence — never commit sensitive apply artifacts.
# local-sensitive/ holds DB backups, per-file detail rows, and card backups (real filenames).
# *.log may embed absolute home paths from third-party libs (pypdf/openpyxl warnings).
**/local-sensitive/
*.sqlite
*.log
# The rerun-qwen-* and correction-* run dirs contain only local-sensitive artifacts + stderr logs;
# their count-only safe summaries are promoted into 20260701T090000Z/05-* and 06-*.
rerun-qwen-*/
correction-*/
